---
// 架构示意简图：概念层级，不含实现细节。
// 分层依据 heron 的架构文档 —— 浏览器 → 接口层 → 编排运行时 → agent → 工具，
// 事件再沿 AG-UI 流回到浏览器。
---

<div class="arch" data-enter="flip">
  <div class="arch__stack">
    <div class="arch__row">
      <div class="arch__box arch__box--you">
        <span class="arch__label">你</span>
        <span class="arch__desc">浏览器里对话 · 审批 · 传附件</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="arch__link"><span class="arch__link-text">请求</span></div>

    <div class="arch__row">
      <div class="arch__box">
        <span class="arch__label">接口层</span>
        <span class="arch__desc">一条会话一条常驻运行线 · 事件流式回传</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="arch__link"><span class="arch__link-text">编排</span></div>

    <div class="arch__row">
      <div class="arch__box arch__box--key">
        <span class="arch__label">运行时</span>
        <span class="arch__desc">多轮常驻 · 抢占与中止 · 从断点恢复</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="arch__link"><span class="arch__link-text">装配</span></div>

    <div class="arch__row">
      <div class="arch__box arch__box--key">
        <span class="arch__label">agent</span>
        <span class="arch__desc">提示词 · 模型 · 工具 · 子 agent</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="arch__link"><span class="arch__link-text">调用</span></div>

    <div class="arch__row arch__row--tools">
      <div class="arch__tool">
        <span class="arch__tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">◔</span>
        <span class="arch__tool-name">读代码</span>
        <span class="arch__tool-desc">检索、追调用链</span>
      </div>
      <div class="arch__tool arch__tool--gate">
        <span class="arch__tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">✎</span>
        <span class="arch__tool-name">改文件 · 执行命令</span>
        <span class="arch__tool-desc">默认要先点头</span>
      </div>
      <div class="arch__tool">
        <span class="arch__tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">⇄</span>
        <span class="arch__tool-name">委派子 agent</span>
        <span class="arch__tool-desc">并行或串行</span>
      </div>
      <div class="arch__tool">
        <span class="arch__tool-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span>
        <span class="arch__tool-name">检索知识库</span>
        <span class="arch__tool-desc">带出处引用</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="arch__link arch__link--back">
      <span class="arch__link-text">事件流回到浏览器</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="arch__note">
    <span class="arch__note-badge">需要你点头的动作</span>
    <span class="arch__note-text">
      走到「改文件 · 执行命令」这类动作时，这一轮当场停住，界面弹出审批卡；
      你批准，它从断点继续；你拒绝，理由写不写都行，写了会回灌给它让它换条路走。
    </span>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .arch {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .arch__stack {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .arch__row {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }

  .arch__box {
    display: grid;
    gap: 5px;
    justify-items: center;
    width: min(100%, 440px);
    padding: 16px 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .arch__box--you {
    border-color: var(--accent-line);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
  }

  .arch__box--key {
    border-color: var(--accent-line);
  }

  .arch__label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .arch__desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* 竖线在文字处断开，不做遮罩 —— 背景有光晕，遮罩会露馅 */
  .arch__link {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    height: 48px;
  }

  .arch__link::before,
  .arch__link::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    width: 1px;
    background: var(--border-strong);
  }

  .arch__link::before {
    top: 0;
    height: 13px;
  }

  .arch__link::after {
    bottom: 8px;
    height: 15px;
  }

  .arch__link-text {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }

  /* 箭头 */
  .arch__link-text::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: -14px;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    margin-left: -3px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent);
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  /* 回流那条：箭头朝上 */
  .arch__link--back::before {
    top: 8px;
    height: 15px;
  }

  .arch__link--back::after {
    bottom: 0;
    height: 13px;
  }

  .arch__link--back .arch__link-text::after {
    bottom: auto;
    top: -14px;
    transform: rotate(225deg);
  }

  .arch__row--tools {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .arch__tool {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    justify-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 16px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .arch__tool--gate {
    border-color: var(--accent-line);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
  }

  .arch__tool-icon {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .arch__tool-name {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .arch__tool-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }

  .arch__note {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
  }

  .arch__note-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .arch__note-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    flex: 1 1 320px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .arch__row--tools {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
